{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> PLAYNESE: Master Japanese</strong> is a JRPG designed for\u00a0<strong><u>anyone learning Japanese</u></strong>, from absolute beginners to advanced, or those preparing for the Japanese Language Tests (like the JLPT).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/0c532aadcb49be0e6b8f5a7c74f8483b.avif?t=1757909295\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong><u>The Study-Play Game Loop</u>:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\ufe0f\u20e3 Study Japanese  to earn money. [Any Japanese level]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\ufe0f\u20e3<strong>\u00a0</strong>Buy powerful cards and battle creatures of a mad scientist.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 \ud83d\udd28Craft, \ud83d\udcb1Trade, \ud83c\udfa3Fish and \ud83c\udf3eHarvest resources.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/5fe017a561c4f39112e5271031b86628.avif?t=1757909295\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u30fb<strong>PLAYNESE</strong> is a deeply in-depth adventure where you\u2019ll have to explore, experiment, and uncover secrets in a constantly growing Open World \ud83c\udf0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/96604fe02d9b03d88d3a40b7a2ac1906.avif?t=1757909295\" width=275 height=200 /></span>\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/07dfa23e23363ceaae35fc03bee1728f.avif?t=1757909295\" width=231 height=231 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEarn badges to unlock new areas, tougher challenges, and exciting experiences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/21e50a2687ac0db0e3225f00cbb2ae59.avif?t=1757909295\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Absorb Japanese naturally while having fun</u>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Key Features</u>:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn and practice Hiragana (\u3072\u3089\u304c\u306a), Katakana (\u30ab\u30bf\u30ab\u30ca) and Kanji (\u6f22\u5b57)</strong> through interactive play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up your Japanese\u00a0</strong>with <strong>Music</strong>, JLPT-aligned content and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Japanese-themed cards</strong> to battle monsters.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/6cd88aea67056117c52325f5d822218d.avif?t=1757909295\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<u>EARLY ACCESS</u>: Constant Updates filled with <u>Language and Adventure</u> :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u307e\u305f\u306d\uff01\uff3c\uff08\uff3e\u25cb\uff3e\uff09\u4eba\uff08\uff3e\u25cb\uff3e\uff09\uff0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/ec5e124fdeeb91138ca38f966ab5f6da.avif?t=1757909295\" width=308 height=461 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764890?t=1757909295","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764890?t=1757909295","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste